The graph shows the temperature $T$ ($^{\circ}\text{C}$) of a warming liquid against time $t$ (minutes). What is the average rate of temperature change over the first $6$ minutes?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x={5/6*1cm},y=0.13cm]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(7.2,0) node[right] {$t$};
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,{4.5/0.13}) node[above] {$T$};
\draw[thick,blue] (0,12) .. controls (1.8,22.8) and (4.2,28.2) .. (6,30);
\draw[thick,dashed,red] (0,12)--(6,30);
\fill (0,12) circle (2pt) node[right] {$(0,12)$};
\fill (6,30) circle (2pt) node[above left] {$(6,30)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The graph of $y = f(x)$ passes through points $A(2, 5)$ and $B(6, 21)$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.85]
\draw[->] (0,0) -- (7.5,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,5.5) node[above] {$y$};
\foreach \x in {1,2,3,4,5,6,7} {\draw (\x,0) -- (\x,-0.12); \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,-0.12) {$\x$};}
\foreach \y/\val in {1/5,2/10,3/15,4/20,5/25} {\draw (-0.12,\y) -- (0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.12,\y) {$\val$};}
\node[below left,font=\scriptsize] at (0,0) {$0$};
\draw[thick,blue] plot[smooth,tension=0.6] coordinates {(1,0.4) (2,1.0) (3,1.8) (4,2.8) (5,3.9) (6,4.2) (7,4.8)} node[above left] {$y=f(x)$};
\draw[thick,dashed,red] (1,0.2) -- (7,5.0);
\fill (2,1.0) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above left,font=\scriptsize,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] at (2,1.0) {$A(2,5)$};
\fill (6,4.2) circle (2.5pt);
\node[below right,font=\scriptsize,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] at (6,4.2) {$B(6,21)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
What is the gradient of the secant line $AB$?

The graph shows the mass $M$ (milligrams) of a culture of cells against time $t$ (hours). What is the average growth rate between $t = 2\text{ h}$ and $t = 7\text{ h}$?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.7cm,y=0.05cm]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(8,0) node[right] {$t$};
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,90) node[above] {$M$};
\draw[thick,blue] (0,10) .. controls (0.6,12) and (1.4,16) .. (2,20) .. controls (3,27) and (6,55) .. (7,80);
\draw[thick,dashed,red] (2,20)--(7,80);
\fill (2,20) circle (2pt) node[above left] {$(2,20)$};
\fill (7,80) circle (2pt) node[above left] {$(7,80)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The graph shows the distance $D$ (metres) travelled by an object against time $t$ (seconds). What is its average speed between $t = 2\text{ s}$ and $t = 7\text{ s}$?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.7cm,y=0.1cm]
\draw[->] (0,0)--({6/0.7},0) node[right] {$t$};
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,50) node[above] {$D$};
\draw[thick,blue] (0,0) .. controls (0.6,2) and (1.4,5) .. (2,8) .. controls (3.25,13.7) and (5.75,26.9) .. (7,43);
\draw[thick,dashed,red] (2,8)--(7,43);
\fill (2,8) circle (2pt) node[above left] {$(2,8)$};
\fill (7,43) circle (2pt) node[above left] {$(7,43)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The graph shows the volume $V$ (litres) remaining in a tank against time $t$ (minutes). What is the average rate of change of volume between $t = 1\text{ min}$ and $t = 4\text{ min}$?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1.25cm,y=0.06cm]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(4.8,0) node[right] {$t$};
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,{5/0.06}) node[above] {$V$};
\draw[thick,blue] (0,69.6) .. controls (0.3,67.2) and (0.7,63.6) .. (1,60) .. controls (1.75,42) and (3.25,27.6) .. (4,24);
\draw[thick,dashed,red] (1,60)--(4,24);
\fill (1,60) circle (2pt) node[above right] {$(1,60)$};
\fill (4,24) circle (2pt) node[above right,xshift=4pt,yshift=4pt] {$(4,24)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The graph shows an object falling from a height of $50\text{ m}$ under gravity.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.85]
\draw[->] (0,0) -- (4.5,0) node[right] {$t$};
\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,5.5) node[above] {$h$};
\foreach \x in {1,2,3,4} {\draw (\x,0) -- (\x,-0.12); \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,-0.12) {$\x$};}
\foreach \y/\val in {1/10,2/20,3/30,4/40,5/50} {\draw (-0.12,\y) -- (0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.12,\y) {$\val$};}
\node[below left,font=\scriptsize] at (0,0) {$0$};
\draw[thick,blue] plot[smooth,tension=0.6] coordinates {(0,5.0) (1,4.5) (2,3.0) (3,0.5)} node[above right] {$h(t)$};
\draw[thick,dashed,red] (1,4.5) -- (3,0.5);
\fill (1,4.5) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above right,font=\scriptsize,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] at (1,4.5) {$(1,45)$};
\fill (3,0.5) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above right,font=\scriptsize,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] at (3,0.5) {$(3,5)$};
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,2.75) {Height (m)};
\node[below] at (2.2,-0.9) {Time (s)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
What is the average rate of change in height between $t = 1\text{ s}$ and $t = 3\text{ s}$?

The graph shows the water level $H$ (metres) in a reservoir against time $t$ (days). What is the average rate of change in the water level over the first $8$ days?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.625cm,y=0.12cm]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(9.6,0) node[right] {$t$};
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,40) node[above] {$H$};
\draw[thick,blue] (0,34) .. controls (2,26) and (6,20) .. (8,18);
\draw[thick,dashed,red] (0,34)--(8,18);
\fill (0,34) circle (2pt) node[right] {$(0,34)$};
\fill (8,18) circle (2pt) node[above right,xshift=4pt,yshift=4pt] {$(8,18)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The graph shows the temperature $T$ ($^{\circ}\text{C}$) of a warming liquid against time $t$ (minutes). What is the average rate of temperature change between $t = 1.2\text{ min}$ and $t = 4.7\text{ min}$? Give your answer to $2$ decimal places.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=0.17cm]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(6,0) node[right] {$t$};
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,{5/0.17}) node[above] {$T$};
\draw[thick,blue] (0,3.8) .. controls (0.36,5.4) and (0.84,7) .. (1.2,8.6) .. controls (2.075,16.5) and (3.825,21.8) .. (4.7,23.4);
\draw[thick,dashed,red] (1.2,8.6)--(4.7,23.4);
\fill (1.2,8.6) circle (2pt) node[below right,xshift=4pt,yshift=-4pt] {$(1.2,8.6)$};
\fill (4.7,23.4) circle (2pt) node[above left] {$(4.7,23.4)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
